// endpoint_watch_login_terminal.proto — WatchLoginTerminal: the login
// pty's OUTPUT stream. WEB LINK section. A SERVER stream (ruled 2026-08-29:
// a WKWebView on a cleartext loopback origin cannot speak a bidirectional
// Connect stream), so the input direction is the unary SendLoginInput —
// keystrokes and resize travel there. Attach replays the session's
// scrollback first, so a late viewer sees the whole TUI. The stream
// CONCLUDES with `closed` when the login child exits — the client re-probes
// the account state then (the topbar chip updates on its own push).

